emerge_transfer -- sharing is a GENE, and TRANSFER is what pays for it
N=16. motif K=3 planted at 1 of 14 positions; train on 3, select on 5, report on 6.
max-pool readout (position never reaches the output). energy = params/(29*14):
  shared = taps, unshared = taps*14. objective = heldout_acc - 1.00*energy.
20 seeds x 200 epochs. GA: pop 24, 50 gens, flips offsets AND the sharing gene.

